      "generated_answer": "McClane opens the fuel hatch as he falls from the plane, then uses his cigarette lighter to ignite the trail of fuel, causing the jet to explode and kill Stuart, Esperanza, and everyone on board.\n\n\\boxed{McClane opens the fuel hatch and ignites the trail of fuel with his lighter, causing the jet to explode and kill Stuart and Esperanza.}",
