    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\"In pace requiescat\" is a Latin phrase that translates to \"Rest in peace.\" It is the final line spoken by Montresor in Edgar Allan Poe's \"The Cask of Amontillado\" after he entombs Fortunato.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Rest in peace}}",
